{
  "key": 25615,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityNorthwestHouse2F_Text_GivingNicknamesIsTheWayToGo",
      "en_US": [
        "Giving nicknames to Pokémon is\n",
        "the way to go.\r",
        "It makes you feel as if they’re your\n",
        "very own."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Il faut donner des noms aux Pokémon.\r",
        "Tu as ainsi l’impression qu’ils\n",
        "t’appartiennent vraiment."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityNorthwestHouse2F_Text_HeNamedPsyduckYellow",
      "en_US": [
        "But he named our PSYDUCK “Yellow”\n",
        "just because of its color...\r",
        "I don’t understand the logic behind\n",
        "that at all."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Il a appelé notre PSYKOKWAK “Jaune”\n",
        "à cause de sa couleur...\r",
        "Je ne comprends pas la logique derrière\n",
        "tout ça."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityNorthwestHouse2F_Text_HereTakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you catching Pokémon?\n",
        "Here, take this if you’d like.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Attrapes-tu des Pokémon?\n",
        "Tiens, prends ça si tu veux.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityNorthwestHouse2F_Text_DuskBallIsDesignedForDarkness",
      "en_US": [
        "The Dusk Ball is a Poké Ball designed\n",
        "for use in darkness.\r",
        "It works better if you use it at\n",
        "night or in a cave."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La Sombre Ball est une Poké Ball conçue\n",
        "pour être utilisée dans l’obscurité.\r",
        "Elle fonctionne mieux si on l’utilise\n",
        "la nuit ou dans les grottes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityNorthwestHouse2F_Text_YellowPsyduckCry",
      "en_US": "Yellow: Duuuck?",
      "fr_FR": "Jaune: Psy kwah?"
    }
  ]
}